；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["panlu-q-da724f865e720b582453"]},"ordering_evidence":"panlu-q-da724f865e720b582453","source_order":[61,268,80],"order":10775},{"id":"panlu-e-p069a","title":"召胤考问胤为太子隐指杨竺","accounts":[{"id":"panlu-a-4a1fd8cdbc08aabfade5","label":"裴注·《吴录》","text":"召胤考问胤为太子隐指杨竺","evidence":["panlu-q-f0baafb3b081eaf0e056"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"召胤考问","evidence":["panlu-q-f0baafb3b081eaf0e056"]},{"person":"panlu-p0027","role":"为太子隐、指杨竺所道","evidence":["panlu-q-f0baafb3b081eaf0e056"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["panlu-q-f0baafb3b081eaf0e056"]},"ordering_evidence":"panlu-q-f0baafb3b081eaf0e056","source_order":[61,268,174],"order":10777}],"persons":[{"id":"panlu-p0027","name":"陆胤","evidence":["panlu-q-29772ed3dbf53184b8e6","panlu-q-bdfa7de6ac69768da749","panlu-q-695526ce441146940a6e","panlu-q-da724f865e720b582453","panlu-q-f0baafb3b081eaf0e056","panlu-q-848817388b20b4e6e3b4","panlu-q-5211944a98b70f4e7ce3","panlu-q-0691712b702b463e876f","panlu-q-a84022fa5913b9af2442","panlu-q-d282c4c2344ba4548df7"],"facts":[{"id":"panlu-f-sr-020","text":"陆胤字敬宗，陆凯之弟","evidence":["panlu-q-a84022fa5913b9af2442"]},{"id":"panlu-f-sr-021","text":"陆胤始为御史，后为尚书选曹郎","evidence":["panlu-q-d282c4c2344ba4548df7"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"panlu-m-2b093c51f18d8e2f3a73","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及陆胤","evidence":["panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"panlu-q-0691712b702b463e876f","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-d4372e52603b4979eb2e","layer":"original","quote":"复讨苍梧建陵贼〖6〗，破之。前后出兵八千余人，以充军用","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"panlu-q-29772ed3dbf53184b8e6","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-89e4b716d2cdb03a47e3","layer":"original","quote":"永安元年，征为西陵督，封都亭侯。后转（左）〔在〕虎林","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"panlu-q-5211944a98b70f4e7ce3","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-8ceccd4940a4df1f11a2","layer":"original","quote":"以胤为交州刺史，安南校尉〖3〗。胤入南界，喻以恩信，务崇招纳；高凉渠帅黄吴等支党三千余家〖4〗，皆出降。引军而南，重宣至诚，遗以财币；贼帅百余人，民五万余家，深幽不羁，莫不稽颡〖5〗：交域清泰。就加安南将军","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":130},{"id":"panlu-q-695526ce441146940a6e","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-008e61d1b7a63eaa0582","layer":"original","quote":"胤卒","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":244,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":2},{"id":"panlu-q-848817388b20b4e6e3b4","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-b41003707cccf82182ea","layer":"original","quote":"胤坐收下狱，楚毒备至，终无他辞","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":70},{"id":"panlu-q-a84022fa5913b9af2442","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-b41003707cccf82182ea","layer":"original","quote":"胤字敬宗。凯弟也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9},{"id":"panlu-q-bdfa7de6ac69768da749","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-89e4b716d2cdb03a47e3","layer":"original","quote":"中书丞华覈表荐胤曰〖8〗：“胤天姿聪朗，才通行洁。昔历选曹，遗迹可纪；还在交州，奉宣朝恩；流民归附，海隅肃清。苍梧、南海，岁有（旧）〔暴〕风瘴气之害：风则折木，飞砂转石；气则雾郁，飞鸟不经。自胤至州，风气绝息，商旅平行；民无疾疫，田稼丰稔。州治临海，海流秋咸〖9〗；胤又蓄水，民得甘食〖10〗。惠风横被，化感人神；遂凭天威，招合遗散。至被诏书当出，民感其恩，已忘恋土；负老携幼，甘心影从，众无携贰〖11〗，不烦兵卫。自诸将合众〖12〗，皆胁之以威；未有如胤，结以恩信者也。衔命在州，十有余年；宾带殊俗〖13〗，宝玩所生；而内无粉黛附珠之妾〖14〗，家无文甲犀象之珍〖15〗：方之今臣，实难多得！宜在辇毂〖16〗，股肱王室〖17〗，以赞唐、虞康哉之颂。江边任轻，不尽其才；虎林选督，堪之者众。若召还都，宠以上司；则天工毕修〖18〗，庶绩咸熙矣","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":30,"end":400},{"id":"panlu-q-d282c4c2344ba4548df7","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-b41003707cccf82182ea","layer":"original","quote":"始为御史。尚书选曹郎。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":9,"end":20},{"id":"panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-3d61488b0ea3fc66bc2f","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：潘濬公清割断〖1〗，陆凯忠壮质直：皆节概梗梗〖2〗，有大丈夫格业〖3〗。胤身洁事济，著称南土，可谓良牧矣","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"panlu-q-da724f865e720b582453","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-2f8f206f4f039d83c0a9","layer":"pei","quote":"胤当至武昌，往辞太子；太子不见，而微服至其车上；与共密议，欲令陆逊表谏","attribution":"裴注·《吴录》","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-90be1bc5b1a157bbf567","start":80,"end":115},{"id":"panlu-q-f0baafb3b081eaf0e056","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-2f8f206f4f039d83c0a9","layer":"pei","quote":"召胤考问，胤为太子隐曰：‘杨竺向臣道之。’遂共为狱","attribution":"裴注·《吴录》","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-90be1bc5b1a157bbf567","start":174,"end":199}],"profiles":{"panlu-p0027":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
